WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Hi!
I need your help.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
My backpack is blue.
My map is in my backpack.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Keks is my helper.
He has green eyes.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Find my backpack.
Get four numbers.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
Open the box.
Tell me where the backpack is.